It is morning in Copenhagen.
I walk to the bus stop.
The weather is very cold today.
It is windy.
The wind is ice-cold.
I am freezing.
I am wearing a thin jacket.
My jacket is not warm at all.
I am also wearing thin shoes.
I am not wearing a warm scarf.
My hands are very cold.
I am shivering.
The winter in Denmark is hard.
I need warm clothes.
I need a thick sweater.
I also need a large scarf.
And I need warm gloves.
I walk very fast.
I am buying winter clothes after work.
